          "title": "You'll want to know: విభేదించు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "విభేదించు — vibhēdiñcu — \"to disagree\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ విషయంలో నేను మీతో విభేదిస్తాను. ā viṣayaṁlō nēnu mītō vibhēdistānu. On that matter I disagree with you."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): విభేదించాను, vibhēdiñcānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Like ఏకీభవించు, it takes -తో: మీతో విభేదిస్తాను."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "విభేదించు (vibhēdiñcu) is built on Sanskrit vibheda, \"a breaking asunder, a division\" (Monier-Williams), with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
