            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆక్షేపించు (ākṣēpiñcu) is built on Sanskrit ākṣepa, \"a drawing together; a throwing away\", and also \"reviling, objection\" (Monier-Williams), with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
