              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వ్యతిరేకత (vyatirēkata) is built on Sanskrit vyatireka, \"distinction, separateness; contrast\" (Monier-Williams), with the abstract ending -త; the verb వ్యతిరేకించు comes from the same word."
